Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: LEHU
Upstream-Contact: Mehmet Tekbas <btekbas@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/mbt28/lehu
Comment: LEHU is a Rust rewrite of FastCarPlay (Niellun and contributors; the
 F1C200s port by Mehmet Tekbas), and its CarPlay and Android Auto code
 follows LIVI's (Lasse Heitgres); NOTICE names the files. The lehu binary
 links Slint under GPL-3.0-only, so a binary as a whole is under GPL
 version 3. THIRD-PARTY.md lists every crate compiled into it with its
 licence and copyright notices. The cargo-vendor component holds the Rust
 crates of Cargo.lock as published on crates.io; crates that no Linux build
 compiles are left as empty stubs.

Files: *
Copyright: 2026 Mehmet Tekbas
           2025-2026 Lasse Heitgres
           Niellun and FastCarPlay contributors
License: GPL-3.0-or-later

