Files: vendor/fontique/* vendor/parley/*
Copyright: the Linebender project contributors
License: Apache-2.0 or MIT
Comment: fontique 0.11.1 and parley 0.11.1, changed as vendor/README.md
 describes.

Files: cargo-vendor/*
Copyright: the authors of each crate, as named in its Cargo.toml and in
 THIRD-PARTY.md
License: various
 Each crate states its licence in its Cargo.toml and licence files: MIT,
 Apache-2.0 (some with the LLVM exception), BSD-1-Clause, BSD-2-Clause,
 BSD-3-Clause, BSL-1.0, ISC, Zlib, 0BSD, Unlicense, CC0-1.0, Unicode-3.0
 or LGPL-2.1-or-later, alone or as alternatives, and Slint's crates
 GPL-3.0-only; all compatible with the GNU GPL version 3.
 THIRD-PARTY.md, in the source and in /usr/share/doc/lehu, carries the
 copyright notices and the licence texts of the crates linked into the
 binary.

